] Within scope, true means an STR filed outside STREAMS 2 on or after 2026-02-02 triggers the separate requirement to resubmit through STREAMS 2. False means this trigger is not satisfied. Neither value determines whether resubmission has occurred or whether the original filing was compliant."},"strongest_uncertainty":"Treating the date-only clause as the resubmission boundary is less closely aligned with the explicit operational launch time. The text does not expressly require resubmission of blackout submissions.","supporting_evidence":[{"quote":"With effect from 2 February 2026, STREAMS 2 will become the only channel for filing STRs2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"for any STRs requiring urgent submission during the blackout period of STREAMS","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"},{"quote":"licensed firms are required to re-submit the STRs via STREAMS 2.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"}]}],"dimensions":{"definitions":{"reading":"STREAMS 2 is the replacement reporting platform. XML submission, upload of a completed prescribed PDF form and completion of the STREAMS 2 web form are distinct permitted methods. Hongkong Post e-Cert is identified as an electronic certificate.","source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u1.383","da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u6.1149","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"uncertainty":"The XML schema, prescribed PDF and technical meaning of satisfying the e-Cert requirement are not supplied."},"dependencies":{"reading":"Classification criteria, technical submission materials and promised resubmission guidance are not available in the packet. Footnote markers and the split webinar link are retained as cross-reference evidence.","source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u8.1235","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","da12aecad4e68.u23.2943","da12aecad4e68.u25.3157","da12aecad4e68.u26.3250","da12aecad4e68.u27.3328","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334","da12aecad4e68.u29.3563","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"uncertainty":"The four missing dependency identifiers have no supplied content or mapping to particular referenced materials. Their contents cannot be inferred."},"exceptions":{"reading":"Urgent STRs during the blackout receive a specific direct-contact route. Footnote 3 attaches to the XML and PDF items carrying its marker; the web-form item has no such marker. Resubmission is a separate obligation and does not expressly authorize an alternative filing channel.","source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u6.1149","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"uncertainty":"Direct contact is not expressly equated with completed STR submission. The attachment of the resubmission obligation to filings during the final morning of the blackout depends on the meaning of implementation."},"modality":{"reading":"The channel and submission-method provisions use required language. XML schema conformity and liaison to arrange a technical test are also required. Account registration and observance of transitional arrangements use should. Urgent blackout contact uses please contact. Platform replacement, migration and access are operational statements rather than equivalent duties imposed on firms.","source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u8.1235","da12aecad4e68.u10.1614","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"uncertainty":"The packet does not establish the legal consequences of the different formulations. This proposal preserves their wording without declaring their legal enforceability."},"scope":{"reading":"The selected duty applies to licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities, collectively defined as licensed firms. The selected control is limited to their post-launch STR filings.","source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0","da12aecad4e68.u3.811"],"uncertainty":"The packet names these actor classes but does not supply the criteria for membership, including the meaning of associated entities."},"time":{"reading":"The general channel rule names 2026-02-02. The operational launch and resumption of acceptance occur at 9:00am that day. The blackout begins at 12:00am on 2026-01-28 and ends when acceptance resumes. The webinar dates are historical background, not an effective date.","source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0","da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","da12aecad4e68.u23.2943"],"uncertainty":"The source does not explicitly specify a timezone or a resubmission deadline. The permitted expression language has dates but no time-of-day type."}},"facts":[{"definition":"The actor belongs to at least one of the three classes collectively called licensed firms in the circular.","name":"is_licensed_firm","requires_professional_judgment":true,"source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0"],"type":"Boolean","units":"Boolean classification"},{"definition":"The event being assessed is submission of an STR to the JFIU, rather than an inquiry, account-registration email or direct contact that has not constituted submission.","name":"is_str_filing","requires_professional_judgment":true,"source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u8.1235","da12aecad4e68.u12.1941","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"Boolean","units":"Boolean event classification"},{"definition":"The event occurs at or after the stated 9:00am operational launch on 2026-02-02, interpreted in the source's applicable time basis. This is an externally supplied temporal classification, not a date-only calculation.","name":"at_or_after_operational_launch","requires_professional_judgment":true,"source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"],"type":"Boolean","units":"Boolean temporal classification"},{"definition":"Gregorian calendar date of the STR filing in the time basis applicable to the circular.","name":"filing_date","requires_professional_judgment":true,"source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u11.1700","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"Date","units":"Gregorian date, YYYY-MM-DD"},{"definition":"The assessed STR submission is made to the JFIU through STREAMS 2.","name":"via_streams2","requires_professional_judgment":false,"source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"],"type":"Boolean","units":"Boolean channel classification"},{"definition":"The selected submission method is submission of the STR in XML format.","name":"is_xml_submission","requires_professional_judgment":false,"source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"],"type":"Boolean","units":"Boolean method classification"},{"definition":"The XML submission follows the separately provided JFIU XML schema. The packet does not supply that schema, so conformity cannot be determined from the packet alone.","name":"xml_schema_conforms","requires_professional_judgment":true,"source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"],"type":"Boolean","units":"Boolean technical conformity assessment"},{"definition":"The selected method uploads a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format, rather than an arbitrary PDF.","name":"is_completed_prescribed_pdf_upload","requires_professional_judgment":true,"source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"],"type":"Boolean","units":"Boolean method and form-conformity assessment"},{"definition":"The selected method completes the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","name":"is_completed_streams2_web_form","requires_professional_judgment":false,"source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"],"type":"Boolean","units":"Boolean method classification"},{"definition":"The assessed submission meets the Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement stated in footnote 3. Mere possession is not assumed sufficient; the source leaves the required technical use unresolved.","name":"submission_ecert_requirement_met","requires_professional_judgment":true,"source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u29.3563","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"type":"Boolean","units":"Boolean certificate-requirement assessment"}],"missing_dependencies":[{"dependency_id":"missing.39ffa0d54487ee68b17a36b8","source_hash":null,"status":"Content unavailable; relationship to individual referenced materials unspecified."},{"dependency_id":"missing.da4d23ff33f664a99e4bf8cc","source_hash":null,"status":"Content unavailable; relationship to individual referenced materials unspecified."},{"dependency_id":"missing.f5f807738efdd34996b25ddc","source_hash":null,"status":"Content unavailable; relationship to individual referenced materials unspecified."},{"dependency_id":"missing.1557ee52aade13863ae98bda","source_hash":null,"status":"Content unavailable; relationship to individual referenced materials unspecified."}],"proposal_status":"Source-grounded interpretive proposals, not legal approvals.","protocol":"legalmath.search.v1","selected_control":{"limits":["The control concerns an individual filing, not whole-firm compliance.","The control does not determine whether an STR must be filed or whether it is timely.","Account registration, technical-test liaison, urgent blackout contact and subsequent resubmission are treated separately.","No supplied facts establish whether any particular firm or filing satisfies the control."],"name":"Post-launch STR channel, submission format and electronic-certificate control","question":"For a licensed firm's STR filing after the operational launch of STREAMS 2, does the filing satisfy the selected channel, format and footnote 3 certificate requirements?"},"separate_obligations_and_arrangements":[{"formalization":null,"name":"Urgent blackout contact","reading":"For STRs requiring urgent submission during the stated blackout, firms are directed to contact the JFIU by the listed email, telephone or fax. This is a specific transitional route, not a general permission to file through those channels after launch.","reason":"The fragment has no time-of-day type, and the packet does not establish when contact constitutes submission. A complete urgent-submission compliance decision would require additional definitions."},{"formalization":null,"name":"Resubmission performance","reading":"Where the footnote 2 trigger applies, licensed firms must resubmit the STR through STREAMS 2. The JFIU says it will provide guidance. This obligation is separate from the original filing's selected-control result.","reason":"The triggers are formalized above. The packet does not supply a performance deadline or enough guidance to decide whether an outstanding resubmission is overdue."},{"formalization":null,"name":"Registration and XML transition preparation","reading":"Firms should register accounts using the specified registration process. Firms intending XML submission must follow the separate schema and liaise with the JFIU as soon as possible to arrange a technical test. The latter wording does not itself state that a passed test is a condition precedent to every XML filing.","reason":"Registration is outside the selected control. Schema conformity is included, but intended use, liaison and the as-soon-as-possible standard require a separate temporal control."}],"shared_formalization":{"control_name":"Post-launch STR channel, submission format and electronic-certificate control","evaluation_rules":["Interpret the result only when scope is established as true.","Unknown facts remain unknown; do not replace missing evidence with false.","The web-form branch means this packet does not attach footnote 3 to that method. It does not establish an exemption from certificate requirements that might appear in unavailable materials."],"result":"(and via_streams2 (or (and is_xml_submission xml_schema_conforms submission_ecert_requirement_met) (and is_completed_prescribed_pdf_upload submission_ecert_requirement_met) is_completed_streams2_web_form))","result_type":"Boolean","scope":"(and is_licensed_firm is_str_filing at_or_after_operational_launch)","source_refs":["da12aecad4e68.u0.0","da12aecad4e68.u3.811","da12aecad4e68.u4.1003","da12aecad4e68.u5.1078","da12aecad4e68.u6.1149","da12aecad4e68.u13.2131","da12aecad4e68.u14.2439","da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] Within scope, true means the filing uses STREAMS 2 and one listed method, with schema conformity for XML and the footnote 3 e-Cert requirement satisfied for XML or PDF. False means at least one requirement of this selected control is not met. Neither outcome decides whole-firm compliance, STR timeliness, account registration or technical-test liaison."},"source_key":"assurance.1d77e5e08a758b5fe0a406b9","substantive_difference":{"common_ground":"Both readings require STREAMS 2 after operational launch, retain the three listed submission methods, attach footnote 3 to XML and PDF, and preserve urgent blackout contact separately.","disputed_case":"An actual STR submitted outside STREAMS 2 on 2026-02-02 before 9:00am falls outside the operational-launch resubmission trigger but inside the implementation-date trigger. A phone call or email that is only contact does not automatically count as such a submission.","relative_support":"The operational-launch reading has stronger support from the express resumption and launch times. The implementation-date reading draws support from the general effective-date clause and its footnote 2 marker.","unresolved_questions":["Does implementation in footnote 2 mean the operational launch time or the start of the stated effective date?","When does urgent blackout contact constitute actual STR submission?","Does the promised guidance require later submission of STRs communicated during any part of the blackout?","What technical act satisfies the Hongkong Post e-Cert requirement?","Which timezone governs the stated hours?"]},"task":"GENERATE","unit_accounting":[{"quote":"licensed corporations, SFC-licensed virtual asset service providers and associated entities (collectively referred to as “licensed firms”)","treatment":"Defines actor scope; the same unit introduces transition by 2026-02-02.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u0.0"},{"quote":"which will replace the current STREAMS platform.","treatment":"Defines the platform transition; efficiency statements supply context, not additional selected-control conditions.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u1.383"},{"quote":"STR submission","treatment":"Heading groups the channel rule and three methods.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u2.795"},{"quote":"Licensed firms are required to submit STRs to the JFIU via STREAMS 2 by one of the following means:","treatment":"Mandatory channel and alternative-method structure; effective-date clause supports the competing temporal readings.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u3.811"},{"quote":"submission of an STR in an Extensible Markup Language (XML) format3;","treatment":"XML method with footnote 3 attachment.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u4.1003"},{"quote":"uploading a completed STR form in the prescribed PDF format3; or","treatment":"Completed prescribed PDF method with footnote 3 attachment.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u5.1078"},{"quote":"completing the web-based STR form in STREAMS 2.","treatment":"Web-form alternative; no footnote 3 marker.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u6.1149"},{"quote":"STREAMS 2 account registration","treatment":"Heading separates registration from submission methods.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u7.1203"},{"quote":"Licensed firms should register STREAMS 2 user accounts to facilitate the prompt submission of STRs.","treatment":"Registration recommendation and form/email process; the registration email is not an alternative STR channel.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u8.1235"},{"quote":"System transitional arrangements","treatment":"Heading identifies the transitional context.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u9.1580"},{"quote":"Licensed firms should observe the JFIU’s transitional arrangements as set out below:","treatment":"Introductory should wording retained alongside more specific provisions.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u10.1614"},{"quote":"the JFIU will cease accepting STR submissions via STREAMS at 12:00am on 28 January 2026","treatment":"Starts the blackout; the remainder specifies resumption through STREAMS 2 at 9:00am on 2026-02-02.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u11.1700"},{"quote":"please contact the JFIU directly by email (jfiu@police.gov.hk), phone at 2866 3366 or fax at 2529 4013;","treatment":"Specific urgent blackout contact route, retained separately.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u12.1941"},{"quote":"All STRs previously submitted through STREAMS will be migrated to STREAMS 2.","treatment":"Launch time, old-platform discontinuation, migration and access statements; migration does not state that firms must resubmit old STREAMS records.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u13.2131"},{"quote":"are required to follow the XML schema provided separately by the JFIU","treatment":"Schema dependency and mandatory XML preparation; liaison to arrange testing remains separate from per-filing assessment.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u14.2439"},{"quote":"Should you have any queries regarding the contents of this circular","treatment":"Inquiry contact information; no additional selected-control requirement.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u15.2675"},{"quote":"Intermediaries Division","treatment":"Issuing-division attribution.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u16.2852"},{"quote":"Securities and Futures Commission","treatment":"Issuer attribution; no invented authority beyond the retained source.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u18.2879"},{"quote":"End","treatment":"Document boundary marker.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u19.2914"},{"quote":"SFO/IS/002/2026","treatment":"Document identifier, not an additional substantive rule.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u20.2919"},{"quote":"held on 17 and 18 November 2025.","treatment":"Footnote 1 historical webinar context and reference to presentation material.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u23.2943"},{"quote":"(https://www.sfc.hk/-/media/EN/files/IS/AML/SFC-AMLCFT-Webinar-202511_JFIU_ENG.pdf?rev=","treatment":"First contiguous fragment of the referenced presentation URL; linked content is not supplied.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u25.3157"},{"quote":"f206230e309e4f5ba196bca77dfe46b9&hash=408F99B6D8750D895676F20D9A09A302).","treatment":"Continuation of the presentation URL, not a separate requirement.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u26.3250"},{"quote":"2","treatment":"Footnote marker linking the channel provision to the following resubmission text.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u27.3328"},{"quote":"The JFIU will provide guidance to facilitate the re-submission.","treatment":"Separate mandatory resubmission provision and unavailable promised guidance.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u28.3334"},{"quote":"3","treatment":"Footnote marker corresponding to XML and PDF submission items.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u29.3563"},{"quote":"Hongkong Post e-Cert (electronic certificate) is required for this submission.","treatment":"Certificate requirement attached to the marked submission methods; technical satisfaction remains unresolved.","unit_id":"da12aecad4e68.u30.3569"}]},"run_id":"run.f9cab12e5709452f9b6e3121495ab6bf"}